# Line-ending policy.
#
# Only file types where CRLF actively breaks a build or tool are pinned to LF.
# The repository already contains ~160 CRLF files (Flutter/Android/iOS scaffold,
# SQL and docs), and a blanket `* text=auto` would renormalise all of them in
# the index on the next commit, turning every unrelated edit into a whole-file
# diff. Those are therefore deliberately left unpinned here; migrating them is
# a separate, explicit `git add --renormalize` change.

# Go
*.go   text eol=lf
go.mod text eol=lf
go.sum text eol=lf

# Shell scripts
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf

# Build files we own (already LF; pinned so they stay that way)
Dockerfile   text eol=lf
*.dockerfile text eol=lf
Makefile     text eol=lf
*.mk         text eol=lf

# Never rewrite binary assets
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
